title: URL Shortener Link in Email
id: ab5806d6-b35d-4928-85ff-73d15df6ebb8
status: experimental
description: Detects inbound emails whose links use URL-shortening services (bit.ly, tinyurl, t.co, cutt.ly), which obscure the true destination and are frequently used to hide phishing landing pages.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/002/
logsource:
  category: mail
detection:
  selection:
    body_url|contains:
      - 'bit.ly/'
      - 'tinyurl.com/'
      - 'cutt.ly/'
      - 'is.gd/'
      - 't.co/'
      - 'rebrand.ly/'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - sender
  - recipient
  - subject
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate marketing shortened links
level: low
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1566.002
